<title>USA: Healthsource buys remainder of ChubbHealth.</title>
<headline>Healthsource buys remainder of ChubbHealth.</headline>
<dateline>HOOKSETT, N.H. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthsource Inc said on Monday that it has closed its previously announced purchase of the remaining 85 percent stake in ChubbHealth Inc from Chubb Corp's life insurance unit for $25.3 million.</p>
<p>ChubbHealth is a 45,000 member health maintenance organization in New York City.</p>
